#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:6
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:8
msgid "There are several useful keyboard shortcuts in mdBook:"
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:10
msgid "<kbd>Arrow-Left</kbd>: Navigate to the previous page."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:11
msgid "<kbd>Arrow-Right</kbd>: Navigate to the next page."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:12
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd>: Execute the code sample that has focus."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:13
msgid "<kbd>s</kbd>: Activate the search bar."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:17
msgid ""
"Mention that these shortcuts are standard for `mdbook` and can be useful "
"when navigating any `mdbook`\\-generated site."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:19
msgid "You can demonstrate each shortcut live to the students."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:20
msgid ""
"The <kbd>s</kbd> key for search is particularly useful for quickly finding "
"topics that have been discussed earlier."
msgstr ""

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md:22
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd> will be super important for you since "
"you'll do a lot of live coding."
msgstr ""
